### Step 0: Login to get token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Step 1.1: Get Document Types (replace YOUR_TOKEN with actual token from above)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/document-types
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

###

### Step 1.2: Get Residents
GET http://localhost:3000/api/residents?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

###

### Step 1.3: Get Pending Requests
GET http://localhost:3000/api/requests?status=pending&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

###
